{
  "$schema": "https://json-schema.org/draft/2020-12/schema",
  "$id": "https://bcp.local/schemas/doudian-category-qualification.schema.json",
  "title": "抖店叶子类目资质要求（单条）",
  "description": "ONE leaf category's qualification requirements —— 发布一个商品实际需要的粒度。\n\n兄弟 schema `doudian-category-schema-capture` 描述的是整份采集产物（reports/doudian-category-qualification.json）：一个 4275 条的大字典。那个形状对产物是对的、对下游是错的 —— 发布一个商品只需要一个类目，而读那个 map 意味着把全部载入内存。\n\n记录的 `source` 是 `file:reports/doudian-category-qualification.json#<叶子id>`，片段形式 —— 同一个叶子跨多次采集算出来是同一个 source，所以入库脚本按它做 upsert（存在则 PATCH、不存在则 POST），既不会重复也不会留旧代。\n\n**读 payload 之前先读 collection.ok**：ok=true 时 payload 为 null 表示抖店确实没下发这一段；ok=false 时 null 只表示【没采到】，不代表没有要求。把两者混为一谈，就会把一个「需要包装标签图」的类目当成「无要求」放行。\n\n`capturedAt` 逐条带上，是为了让「库里这条是哪一代」成为可查的事实 —— 否则一次没换成的入库会静默留下旧数据。",
  "type": "object",
  "required": [
    "cid",
    "name",
    "path",
    "capturedAt",
    "collection"
  ],
  "additionalProperties": false,
  "properties": {
    "cid": {
      "type": "string",
      "pattern": "^[0-9]+$",
      "description": "叶子类目 id，与 doudian-category-tree 里 is_leaf=true 的节点一一对应。字符串而非数字：抓下来的原始 key 就是字符串，转成数字会在 JS 里丢精度。"
    },
    "name": {
      "type": "string",
      "minLength": 1
    },
    "path": {
      "type": "string",
      "minLength": 1,
      "description": "类目全路径，斜杠分隔"
    },
    "capturedAt": {
      "type": "string",
      "format": "date-time",
      "description": "本条数据出自哪一次采集。三份产物（树/属性/资质）同一次运行共享此值。"
    },
    "collection": {
      "type": "object",
      "required": [
        "ok"
      ],
      "additionalProperties": false,
      "properties": {
        "ok": {
          "type": "boolean"
        },
        "error": {
          "type": "string",
          "description": "ok=false 时的错误原文，不做归纳"
        },
        "reason": {
          "type": "string",
          "description": "ok=false 时的人话解释"
        }
      }
    },
    "qualification": {
      "oneOf": [
        {
          "type": "object",
          "additionalProperties": true,
          "description": "抖店下发的原样结构，**不做字段挑选**。这里只把下游确实依赖的字段写出来备查，并不限制 additionalProperties —— 形状归抖店所有，枚举死会让它加一个字段就把校验搞红。",
          "properties": {
            "id": {
              "type": "string"
            },
            "label": {
              "type": "string"
            },
            "required": {
              "type": "boolean"
            },
            "hidden": {
              "type": "boolean"
            },
            "available": {
              "type": "boolean"
            },
            "items": {
              "type": "array",
              "items": {
                "type": "object",
                "additionalProperties": true,
                "properties": {
                  "id": {
                    "type": "string"
                  },
                  "label": {
                    "type": "string",
                    "description": "显示名。**不是 name** —— 旧形状里叫 name，迁移最容易踩这里。"
                  },
                  "required": {
                    "type": "boolean"
                  },
                  "hidden": {
                    "type": "boolean"
                  },
                  "available": {
                    "type": "boolean"
                  },
                  "placeholder": {
                    "type": "string",
                    "description": "多选属性的数量上限「最多选N项」写在这里"
                  },
                  "required_tips": {
                    "type": "string"
                  },
                  "rules": {
                    "type": "array",
                    "items": {
                      "type": "object",
                      "additionalProperties": true
                    }
                  },
                  "options": {
                    "type": "array",
                    "description": "可选值。对象数组，**不是** [value_id, value_name] 二元组。",
                    "items": {
                      "type": "object",
                      "additionalProperties": true,
                      "properties": {
                        "value_id": {
                          "type": "string"
                        },
                        "value_name": {
                          "type": "string"
                        },
                        "additions": {
                          "type": [
                            "object",
                            "null"
                          ],
                          "additionalProperties": true
                        }
                      }
                    }
                  },
                  "additions": {
                    "type": "object",
                    "additionalProperties": true,
                    "properties": {
                      "diy_type": {
                        "type": "integer"
                      },
                      "ui_type": {
                        "type": "string"
                      }
                    }
                  }
                }
              }
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "type": "null"
        }
      ],
      "description": "抖店 getSchema 的 data.model.qualification 原样。判「这个类目能不能发」看 items[*].required && !hidden && available !== false —— 2026-09-03 实测 4236 个可采类目里 139 个存在必填资质（134 个要包装标签图、6 个要质检报告），我们出不了证件图，这些类目发布必挂，应在预处理阶段就阻断。"
    }
  }
}